Id":"egs:creator:22223","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:22223","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:22223","name":"株式会社こだまプロダクション","detail":"効果音","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:255989","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"株式会社アルカディアワークス","creatorId":"egs:creator:31998","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:31998","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:31998","name":"株式会社アルカディアワークス","detail":"販売","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:255990","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"長月うい","creatorId":"vndb:s18604","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:33423","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s18604","name":"長月うい","detail":"CG監修、CG彩色、背景","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:255991","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"だいこん","creatorId":"egs:creator:38717","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:38717","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:38717","name":"だいこん","detail":"CG彩色、背景、システムグラフィック","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:255992","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"ぺぺ","creatorId":"egs:creator:38718","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:38718","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:38718","name":"ぺぺ","detail":"CG彩色、背景","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:255993","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"たいのね","creatorId":"vndb:s14729","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14729","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14729","name":"たいのね","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:157385","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"金岡 さざん","creatorId":"vndb:s14905","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14905","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14905","name":"佐藤 輝政","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:157389","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"金岡 さざん","creatorId":"vndb:s14905","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14905","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14905","name":"佐藤 輝政","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:157390","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c84379","characterName":"椎名 真穂","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"70880","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"283174"}],"egsCharacterIds":["21812"],"vndbCharacterId":"c84379"},"originalCharacterName":"椎名 真穂","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The landlord of \"Koubou Shiina\", she takes care of the apartments and her tenants' needs. However, she is a closet Doujinshi manga artist and is constantly looking for ways to improve her output through research. One of her apartments is empty, so she welcomes Kamikura Hina's referral of a new tenant. An unfortunate \"accident\" reveals her secret to Oogaki Koutarou, but his reaction to her secret hobby is so unexpected she makes an unusual offer to him regarding \"reference materials\"."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"When she was still in school Maho was not very outgoing and spent most of her time reading books. During a school cultural festival she was forced into the literature committee and came up with a mascot which proved to be unexpectedly popular. Coupled with her own love of manga, she started her secret hobby as a manga artist focusing on adult-orientated works."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"For her research, she's willing to order adult goods online and receives costumes from fellow hobbyists. She refused to engage in cosplay for many years despite the costumes."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"With Koutarou's assistance, the realism and quality of her output increases. Eventually she gets a big break at a convention when a magazine scouts her out for publication. Although she took up the hobby never intending it to be her livelihood, Koutarou encourages her to take up the challenge and vows to support her any way he can."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c84379"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"父親が定年後に経営を始めたアパート「コーポ椎名」の管理人であり大家さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美しい黒髪に整った顔立ち、穏やかで優しい性格とスキのない完璧美人・・・見えるが、実はガチガチのエロマンガを描き続けているエロ同人作家というヒミツの顔がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"活動内容が内容なので活動については口外できていなかったが、とあるきっかけで幸太郎に知られてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の夢を認めてもらった嬉しさがあり、勢い余って「エッチの資料集めを手伝ってほしい」と幸太郎にお願いしてしまい、そこから肉体関係が始まってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本はしっかり者だけど時々ヌけてしまうところもある可愛げのある黒髪美人さん。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21812","sourceWorkId":"27974","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"父親が定年後に経営を始めたアパート「コーポ椎名」の管理人であり大家さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美しい黒髪に整った顔立ち、穏やかで優しい性格とスキのない完璧美人…に見えるが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実はガチガチのエロマンガを描き続けているエロ同人作家というヒミツの顔がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"活動内容が内容なので活動については口外できていなかったが、とあるきっかけで幸太郎に知られてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の夢を認めてもらった嬉しさがあり、勢い余って「エッチの資料集めを手伝ってほしい」と幸太郎にお願いしてしまい、そこから肉体関係が始まってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本はしっかり者だけど時々ヌけてしまうところもある可愛げのある黒髪美人さん。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"70880"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4f/4fc964a0e7298ee652616f7bf971aa65d38569915b35bcf50d3737414b4e0d86.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/91/91521d327371f24dadd9855ce6363b1841ff8ae2c8cd1e555fa09624f676e81f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"野中カオリ","creatorId":"vndb:s106","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s106","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s106","name":"野中 カオリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:283174:70880:6409:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c84381","characterName":"大垣 幸太郎","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"92140","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"283174"}],"egsCharacterIds":["21816"],"vndbCharacterId":"c84381"},"originalCharacterName":"大垣 幸太郎","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A university student who is forced to find new accommodation in summer when a small fire damages his rented apartment (the landlord is old and impecunious and the repairs for such an old flat make it more economical to just tear it down). His senior Kamikura Hina introduces him to \"Koubou Shiina\" and its landlord, and he accepts the offer as the rent is just as cheap as his previous tenancy (amongst other reasons)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He does not have a goal in life, so he respects those who have a dream and work towards it. To make ends meet, he works part-time at a supermarket."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c84381"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヒロインの真帆が大家をしているアパートに訳あって引っ越してきた主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アパート近くの大学に通う大学生でありスーパーでバイトもしている勤勉な性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大学生にもなってまだ明確な夢や目標が持てていない自分にわずかな焦りを感じており、エロマンガとはいえ明確な夢をもっている真帆に惹かれていく。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21816","sourceWorkId":"27974","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヒロインの真穂が大家をしているアパートに訳あって引っ越してきた主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アパート近くの大学に通う大学生でありスーパーでバイトもしている勤勉な性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大学生にもなってまだ明確な夢や目標が持てていない自分にわずかな焦りを感じており、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エロマンガとはいえ明確な夢をもっている真穂に惹かれていく。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92140"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ed/edc132b193da14e8f84faebd42edade07e99219e5c8c7f19bc96410188a15797.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e7/e778d30eebe437f869de7e470a1fdbf2e5ba13280d8b4b8980db20126b073c1e.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c84382","characterName":"上倉 雛","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"70881","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"283174"},{"characterId":"70881","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"294943"}],"egsCharacterIds":["21813"],"vndbCharacterId":"c84382"},"originalCharacterName":"上倉 雛","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The former ace of the university swimming club, an injury forces her withdrawal from active swimming and she focuses on managing the club instead. Koutarou's senior at the University and the person who introduces him to Koubou Shiina and its landlord."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's addicted to pudding. She claims she can easily have it for three meals a day and extorts Koutarou for a limited edition version from her favourite shop in exchange for a referral fee to the new apartment."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c84382"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幸太郎の大学の友達。スポーツ（水泳）の特待生としてやってきたスポーツマン...だったが"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今は故障中でマネージャー活動をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あっけらかんとした清々しい性格で、正直あまり異性を感じさせない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幸太郎に対しても当然恋愛感情はなく、なんかノリが合う女友達、といった程度。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"この距離感が逆に心地よくて友人を続けている感じ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いい意味でサバサバしているが、プリンが何より大好きという乙女っぽい一面もある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21813","sourceWorkId":"27974","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"前作「椎名真穂のヒミツ」にも登場したスポーツ系女子大学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真と同じ一ノ瀬大学の水泳部に所属し、マネージャーを務めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もともとは選手だったが、あるトラブルに見舞われ足を故障。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それ以後は裏方として部員たちをサポートしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るさが服を着て歩いているような元気のいい女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人当たりがよく面倒見のいい性格から部の内外問わず人気が高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみにプリンが何より好き。主食にしても大丈夫なぐらい好き。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21813","sourceWorkId":"28927","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幸太郎の大学の友達。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スポーツ（水泳）の特待生としてやってきたスポーツマン…だったが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今は故障中でマネージャー活動をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あっけらかんとした清々しい性格で、正直あまり異性を感じさせない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幸太郎に対しても当然恋愛感情はなく、なんかノリが合う女友達、といった程度。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"この距離感が逆に心地よくて友人を続けている感じ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いい意味でサバサバしているが、プリンが何より大好きという乙女っぽい一面もある。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"70881"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6b/6b525887826ddecfba923640bab3de059245a92b94943eee99d85de7e0771931.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/466100a43ee58f18c6cd0155f420674eb34fca740e1341ed7f9b8ebe2e8443c7.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"風花ましろ","creatorId":"vndb:s5762","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5762","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5762","name":"中野 純花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:283174:70881:20833:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c84383","characterName":"カズねぇ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"92138","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"283174"}],"egsCharacterIds":["21815"],"vndbCharacterId":"c84383"},"originalCharacterName":"カズねぇ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He works at a bar in the commercial district close to the maintenance agents Maho relies on for apartment repairs. He favours affectionate physical contact with Koutarou, which gives the latter the chills."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"When he meets Maho and Koutarou by chance after their tryst, he finds out they are in a physical relationship and advises Koutarou to make his feelings clear in order to develop the relationship into something more tangible."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c84383"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アパートのご近所さん。ちなみに本名は不明。本人いわく「乙女の秘密よ！」とのこと。中身は乙女だが外見は完全にオッサン。だけど心が乙女なので問題はないらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"近くの繁華街でバーを営んでいるママであり、そのざっくばらんな性格から「カズねぇ」という呼び名で慕われている。なんだかんだで人望がある面倒見のいいお姉（？）さま。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみに虫が苦手という本当に乙女らしい弱点も持っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21815","sourceWorkId":"27974","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アパートのご近所さん。ちなみに本名は不明。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人いわく「乙女の秘密よ！」とのこと。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"中身は乙女だが外見は完全にオッサン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だけど心が乙女なので問題はないらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"近くの繁華街でバーを営んでいるママであり、そのざっくばらんな性格から「カズねぇ」という呼び名で慕われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なんだかんだで人望がある面倒見のいいお姉（？）さま。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみに虫が苦手という本当に乙女らしい弱点も持っている（どうでもいい）"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92138"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/11/1150fe5c2828155023957536ccccae8798b314043953b2bec4290e3b3d9987e8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/77/777ac97326863bce490058f9c5a3d77f21080ef07677eb9c52365a43304fd92b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c84384","characterName":"衣笠 満","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"92139","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"283174"}],"egsCharacterIds":["21814"],"vndbCharacterId":"c84384"},"originalCharacterName":"衣笠 満","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"His mania for baseball rivals Hina's obsession with pudding. He's so devoted to the sport (which he considers the pinnacle of team sport) he'll strongarm Koutarou into signing up for the baseball team fan club which he supports. He's always dressed in the fan uniform of his favourite baseball team. Despite his physique, he doesn't play the sport at all. He owns a bicycle which he uses to cycle to stadiums to watch games (professional league, high school etc.) when his budget allows and relies on the television in his room when he's unable to watch games at stadiums."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c84384"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幸太郎や雛と同じ大学に通う大学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"狂おしいほどの野球好きで、常に最愛のチームのユニフォームを着用しているほど。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幸太郎とは直接の知り合いではなかったが、引っ越しに際して雛づたいで知り合うことになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"野球を狂おしいほどに愛しているが本人は野球の選手というわけでもない。ただのファン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしその熱量は本物で、近隣で試合があるときは槍が降ってでも赴く。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"またチケット代もバイトで捻出しており、筋を通すべきところは通す男前。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あらゆる比喩表現が野球関係になってしまうので、野球に詳しくない人だと「何言ってんだコイツ」となってしまうことこの上ない；　でも悪人ではないことは確かである。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"21814","sourceWorkId":"27974","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幸太郎や雛と同じ大学に通う大学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"狂おしいほどの野球好きで、常に最愛のチームのユニフォームを着用しているほど。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幸太郎とは直接の知り合いではなかったが、引っ越しに際して雛づたいで知り合うことになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"野球を狂おしいほどに愛しているが本人は野球の選手というわけでもない。ただのファン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしその熱量は本物で、近隣で試合があるときは槍が降ってでも赴く。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"またチケット代もバイトで捻出しており、筋を通すべきところは通す男前。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あらゆる比喩表現が野球関係になってしまうので、野球に詳しくない人だと「何言ってんだコイツ」となってしまうことこの上ない"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"でも悪人ではないことは確かである。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92139"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"htt